{"id":"n3-066","title":"～としたら","romaji":"〜to shitara","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Express a hypothetical situation; 'if', 'suppose', 'assuming'.","longExplanation":"The ～としたら grammar point is used to express a hypothetical situation or assumption. It can be translated as 'if', 'suppose', or 'assuming' in English. The formation differs depending on whether it is used with a verb, い-adjective, な-adjective, or noun.","formation":"Verb-casual + としたら, い-Adjective + としたら, な-Adjective + だとしたら, Noun + だとしたら","examples":[{"jp":"明日雨が降るとしたら、傘を持って行きましょう。","romaji":"Ashita ame ga furu to shitara, kasa wo motte ikimashou.","en":"If it rains tomorrow, let's bring an umbrella.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降る","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"傘","vocabId":"1301940","reading":"かさ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"持っ","vocabId":"1315720","reading":"もつ","baseForm":"持つ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"このケーキが美味しくないとしたら、誰も食べないでしょう。","romaji":"Kono keeki ga oishikunai to shitara, daremo tabenai deshou.","en":"If this cake is not delicious, nobody will eat it.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ケーキ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しく","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい","baseForm":"美味しい"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誰","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"彼が病気だとしたら、すぐに病院に行かせてあげてください。","romaji":"Kare ga byouki da to shitara, sugu ni byouin ni ikasete agete kudasai.","en":"If he is sick, please take him to the hospital right away.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"病気","vocabId":"1490230","reading":"びょうき"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"病院","vocabId":"1490220","reading":"びょういん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行か","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"せ","vocabId":"2147990","reading":"せ","baseForm":"せる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あげ","vocabId":"1352300","reading":"あげ","baseForm":"あげる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"彼女が学生だとしたら、このレストランは割引があるでしょう。","romaji":"Kanojo ga gakusei da to shitara, kono resutoran wa waribiki ga aru deshou.","en":"If she is a student, there will be a discount at this restaurant.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学生","vocabId":"1206900","reading":"がくせい"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":